{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": [
    "THE MODEL REGISTRY — the one table of models, providers and prices.",
    "This file in the repo is the BUNDLED DEFAULT. On a deployment it is copied once",
    "into <DATA_ROOT>/models.json and that copy is what Settings -> Administration ->",
    "Models edits; the bundle is never written to on a deployment. Locally DATA_ROOT",
    "IS this directory, so local edits land here — same arrangement as data/styles.",
    "",
    "PRICES ARE PER MILLION TOKENS, in USD, exactly as the provider publishes them.",
    "That is deliberate: two Gemini rows were wrong for months because nothing ever",
    "compared them to the source page, and a per-token float cannot be compared by eye.",
    "Every row carries the URL it was read from and the date it was read. No provider",
    "API exposes pricing, so this is hand-entered and the admin UI flags rows that have",
    "not been checked in 90 days.",
    "",
    "`verified` is written ONLY by the admin Verify action (one real request per stage",
    "schema). Never hand-edit it — a hand-written tick is a claim nobody tested."
  ],
